# --- never commit Arturia's own files --------------------------------------
# The bundled name table (beatstep/data/beatstep_tables.json) is fine to ship:
# it is parameter numbers + value enums (interoperability facts) plus generic,
# industry-standard labels and our own grouping. But Arturia's raw MCC device
# dictionary and their template/project files are Arturia's IP -- never commit
# those, and never commit the reference folder they come from.
